<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 20.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali receives Mohamed Belhadj Amor, leader of the opposition Parti de l'Unite Populaire; renews attachment to democratic principles.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisian businesswomen exhibition starts.</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali names new ambassadors to Turkey, Czech Republic, Sweden and Great Britain.</p>
</text>
